WEBVTT

NOTE RJ Tech bilingual subtitles — Chinese above, English below.

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:08.300
将旧电池仓从原车上取下。
Remove the original battery tray from the vehicle.

2
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:18.410
取下图示的橡胶垫和平垫，并保留其安装顺序。
Remove the rubber pads and flat washers shown, keeping their installed order.

3
00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:24.410
只处理后部中间的指定固定点。
Modify only the specified rear-center fixing point.

4
00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:31.623
可将该固定点切断或磨除，并把表面处理平整。
Cut or grind off that fixing point and finish the remaining surface smooth.

5
00:00:32.423 --> 00:00:41.323
确认其余五个螺柱、橡胶垫和平垫全部在位。
Confirm that the remaining five studs, rubber pads and flat washers are all present.

6
00:00:41.423 --> 00:00:49.423
换上新的电池仓。
Position the new battery tray.

7
00:00:49.823 --> 00:00:55.023
将电池仓平稳放入，避免压住线束或垫片。
Lower the tray into place without trapping a harness or washer.
